Z4 under +: identity 0, inverses true, associative true, commutative true: a group
1..4 times mod 5: identity 1, inverses true, associative true, commutative true: a group
1..5 times mod 6: not closed (2, 3 gives 0)
1,3,5,7 times mod 8: identity 1, inverses true, associative true, commutative true: a group
0..3 under xor: identity 0, inverses true, associative true, commutative true: a group
0..2 minus mod 3: closed, no identity
0..4 times mod 5: identity 1, inverses false, associative true, commutative true: not a group
